      "code": "fuzzer_do_request_from_buffer(\"fuzzer.php\", s, Size);",
      "note": "The libFuzzer harness hands the exact staged PHP script buffer to the engine. Source scoring begins later inside `zend_compile_attributes()`, but this is the saved entry from the harness into project code.",
